<div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Graphical_updates">Graphical updates</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/Nex?section=34&amp;veaction=edit" title="Edit section: Graphical updates" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/w/Nex?action=edit&amp;section=34" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Graphical updates"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p>Nex was graphically updated in September <a href="/w/2012" title="2012">2012</a> along with the rest of <a href="/w/God_Wars_Dungeon" title="God Wars Dungeon">God Wars Dungeon</a>. She was updated again in January <a href="/w/2017" title="2017">2017</a> with the release of <a href="/w/Nex,_Angel_of_Death" title="Nex, Angel of Death">Nex, Angel of Death</a>, with her new model being a slightly modified version of the one in the new encounter. However she still uses the 2012 model in <a href="/w/The_World_Wakes" title="The World Wakes">The World Wakes</a>, <a href="/w/Fate_of_the_Gods" title="Fate of the Gods">Fate of the Gods</a>, <a href="/w/Gower_Quest" title="Gower Quest">Gower Quest</a> and <a href="/w/Battle_of_the_Monolith" title="Battle of the Monolith">Battle of the Monolith</a>.
</p>
