<div class="update-history">
<ul><li><span class="update-list"><span class="update-type patch-update"><a href="/w/Patch_Notes" title="Patch Notes">patch</a></span> <b>7 April 2026&#160;(<a href="/w/Update:April_Patch_Week" title="Update:April Patch Week">Update</a>):</b></span>
<ul><li>The stalagmites in the ice prison attack that Nex performs now have a 100% chance to be broken by an assisting player.</li></ul></li></ul>
<ul><li><span class="update-list"><span class="update-type hidden-update"><a href="/w/Hidden_updates" title="Hidden updates">hidden</a></span> <b>11 September 2023&#160;(<a href="/w/Update:Necromancy_Patch_Week_-_This_Week_In_RuneScape" title="Update:Necromancy Patch Week - This Week In RuneScape">Update</a>):</b></span>
<ul><li>The 50% combat experience reduction on bosses has been removed. Bosses now give 50 combat experience per 1,000 life points, like most other monsters in the game.</li></ul></li></ul>
<ul><li><span class="update-list"><span class="update-type update-update"><a href="/w/Game_updates" title="Game updates">update</a></span> <b>7 November 2022&#160;(<a href="/w/Update:Garden_of_Kharid_%26_DXP:_LIVE_Friday!_-_This_Week_In_RuneScape" title="Update:Garden of Kharid &amp; DXP: LIVE Friday! - This Week In RuneScape">Update</a>):</b></span>
<ul><li>Herb drops replaced with their seeds instead.</li></ul></li></ul>
<ul><li><span class="update-list"><span class="update-type patch-update"><a href="/w/Patch_Notes" title="Patch Notes">patch</a></span> <b>14 March 2022&#160;(<a href="/w/Update:This_Week_In_RuneScape:_Combat_Cleanup_Strike" title="Update:This Week In RuneScape: Combat Cleanup Strike">Update</a>):</b></span>
<ul><li>Reduced the length of the intro animation to allow the encounter to start faster.</li></ul></li></ul>
<ul><li><span class="update-list"><span class="update-type patch-update"><a href="/w/Patch_Notes" title="Patch Notes">patch</a></span> <b>11 January 2021&#160;(<a href="/w/Update:This_Week_In_RuneScape:_Celebration_of_Combat#Patch_Notes" title="Update:This Week In RuneScape: Celebration of Combat">Update</a>):</b></span>
<ul><li>Various bosses around RuneScape have taken their Santa Hats off for another year.</li></ul></li></ul>
<ul><li><span class="update-list"><span class="update-type patch-update"><a href="/w/Patch_Notes" title="Patch Notes">patch</a></span> <b>1 September 2020&#160;(<a href="/w/Update:This_Week_In_RuneScape_-_01/09/20#Patch_Notes" title="Update:This Week In RuneScape - 01/09/20">Update</a>):</b></span>
<ul><li>Players are now able to use <a href="/w/Movement_abilities" title="Movement abilities">movement abilities</a>, such as Surge, in the <a href="/w/Vorago" title="Vorago">Vorago</a>, Nex, and <a href="/w/Telos" class="mw-redirect" title="Telos">Telos</a> instance lobbies.</li></ul></li></ul>
<ul><li><span class="update-list"><span class="update-type patch-update"><a href="/w/Patch_Notes" title="Patch Notes">patch</a></span> <b>4 May 2020&#160;(<a href="/w/Update:Patch_Notes_(4_May_2020)" title="Update:Patch Notes (4 May 2020)">Update</a>):</b></span>
<ul><li>Luminite and runite stone spirits have been replaced by phasmatite and necrite stone spirits.</li></ul></li></ul>
<ul><li><span class="update-list"><span class="update-type hotfix-update"><a href="/w/Patch_Notes" title="Patch Notes">hotfix</a></span> <b>3 February 2020&#160;(<a href="/w/Update:Patch_Notes_(3_February_2020)" title="Update:Patch Notes (3 February 2020)">Update</a>):</b></span>
<ul><li><a href="/w/Ancient_Ceremonial" class="mw-redirect" title="Ancient Ceremonial">Ancient Ceremonial</a> will once again bypass the kill count requirement when trying to enter the Nex boss area.</li></ul></li></ul>
<ul><li><span class="update-list"><span class="update-type patch-update"><a href="/w/Patch_Notes" title="Patch Notes">patch</a></span> <b>28 January 2019&#160;(<a href="/w/Update:Patch_Notes_(28_January_2019)" title="Update:Patch Notes (28 January 2019)">Update</a>):</b></span>
<ul><li>Instead of coal stone spirits, will now drop luminite stone spirits.</li></ul></li></ul>
<ul><li><span class="update-list"><span class="update-type patch-update"><a href="/w/Patch_Notes" title="Patch Notes">patch</a></span> <b>21 January 2019&#160;(<a href="/w/Update:Patch_Notes_(21_January_2019)" title="Update:Patch Notes (21 January 2019)">Update</a>):</b></span>
