<ul><li><span class="update-list"><span class="update-type patch-update"><a href="/w/Patch_Notes" title="Patch Notes">patch</a></span> <b>20 August 2013&#160;(<a href="/w/Update:Patch_Notes_(20_August_2013)" title="Update:Patch Notes (20 August 2013)">Update</a>):</b></span>
