<ul><li><span class="update-list"><span class="update-type update-update"><a href="/w/Game_updates" title="Game updates">update</a></span> <b>10 January 2011&#160;(<a href="/w/Update:God_Wars_Dungeon_-_The_Ancient_Prison" title="Update:God Wars Dungeon - The Ancient Prison">Update</a>):</b></span>
